\par\par \b \uc2 Emerging Market  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Mixed; Debt Steady\b0\par\par\uc2 492 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2012\par 21:04\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 -- Emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  mixed ahead of weekend\par \par \uc2 -- Emerging market debt little changed\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Erin McCarthy \par    Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 NEW YORK (Dow Jones)--Emerging market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  were mixed Friday, while sovereign debt was little changed, as broader markets lacked conviction.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Emerging market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ' direction in recent days have largely been in response to the dollar's moves, as rising Treasury yields lifted the U.S. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . But softer U.S. data and directionless U.S. equities Friday appeared to give traders less enthusiasm for emerging markets ahead of the weekend.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Investors are also reevaluating how much farther this year's rally for emerging market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  can go, analysts say. However, calmer market dynamics should allow for investors to differentiate more among emerging market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , according to analysts.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "We're moving into a world where maybe idiosyncratic elements are increasingly more important," said Nomura economist Benito Berber.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The South African rand was the day's outperformer, but other \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  seen as risk proxies, like the Mexican peso and Turkish lira, were flat on the day as investors squared positions ahead of the weekend.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Emerging market sovereign debt was little changed, firming up slightly against U.S. Treasurys. The risk premium on the \f28 \uc2 \f2 J.P. Morgan\f28 \uc2 \f2  Emerging Markets Bond Index Global, or Embig, tightened three basis points to 320 basis points over Treasurys. In price terms, its index slipped 0.2%.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Among \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , the Brazilian real weakened slightly against the dollar, as the threat of further \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  looms over the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Brazil\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's government and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  recently have undertaken a series of measures to curb the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's strength, including financial-\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  taxes on certain kinds of investments and dollar purchases in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market, respectively. The dollar edged up to BRL1.8009 from BRL1.7983 late Thursday, according to CQG.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The real continues to be a story of they're going to do more measures to contain appreciation," said Nomura's Berber.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Mexican peso was nearly flat on the day, as U.S. stocks remained rangebound and Mexico's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  stuck to the status quo, holding its key policy rate at 4.5% for the 25th meeting in a row. The dollar bought MXN12.6596 late Friday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The South African rand bucked the trend Friday, gaining 0.6% against the dollar, which traded at ZAR7.5837. The rand has been "the strongest-performing \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 " among African \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  over the last month, though it started from a much lower base, analysts at Standard Bank said in a note.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Within emerging Europe, the Turkish lira was little changed on the day against the dollar, while the Russian ruble advanced modestly against the U.S. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  as it tracked rising oil prices. The dollar traded at RUB29.238 from RUB29.389 late Thursday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -By Erin McCarthy, Dow Jones Newswires; 212-416-2712; erin.mccarthy@dowjones.com @djfxtrader [ 16-03-12 2004GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120316e83g0012i\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
