\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil's  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  To Buy Dollars At 2nd Auction\b0\par\par\uc2 195 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2012\par 20:07\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  -- \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  -- \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    DOW JONES NEWSWIRES \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SAO PAULO (Dow Jones)--Brazil's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  bought U.S. dollars at a second auction on Friday for BRL1.7260 to the dollar, the bank said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  didn't reveal the volume of dollars purchased.\f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Brazil\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's government has ramped up \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets in recent days, frequently carrying out two spot auctions or buying dollars for future delivery. The government, which has also extended taxes on loans in recent days, is trying to weaken the country's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on concerns it makes exports less competitive.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 However, the recent tax increase--an extension of the so-called IOF tax of 6% to foreign loans with a maturity of up to three years, from a previous tax on loans of up to two years--isn't expected to have long-term effects. \f28 \uc2 \f2 Barclays\f28 \uc2 \f2  and Goldman said in Friday notes that new Brazilian taxes in inflows will likely provide temporary relief but are unlikely to reverse the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's appreciation.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -By Paulo Winterstein, Dow Jones Newswires; 55-11-3544-7073; paulo.winterstein@dowjones.com [ 02-03-12 1927GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120302e8320012v\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
