\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS- \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  real hits 4-mo high, cenbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 483 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Februar 2012\par 18:14\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Recasts with \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , updates prices)\par \par \uc2 * Mexican peso weakens after poor PMI data in Europe\par \par \uc2 * Chilean peso also down on falling copper prices\par \par \uc2 * Brazil real breaks trend, opens firmer after carnival holiday\par \par \uc2 MEXICO CITY, Feb 22 (Reuters) - The Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strengthened on Wednesday to its strongest level against the dollar in almost four months, triggering the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Other Latin American \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  mostly weakened due to mounting fears that the euro zone may be heading toward recession and to persistent concern over debt-laden Greece despite a fresh bailout.\par \par \uc2 The Brazilian real gained 0.41 percent to 1.7070 per dollar, as the market digested positive news from earlier in the week after a two-day carnival holiday.\par \par \uc2 "The Greek rescue deal is adding momentum to the real as the market just reopened today," said Caio Duarte, chief economist with Lopes Filho in Sao Paulo.\par \par \uc2 The real has appreciated more than 9 percent so far this year.\par \par \uc2 The real's sharp gains could put the country's exporters at a competitive disadvantage and Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sought to curb its rise by buying dollars in the spot market on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 Surveys of purchasing managers published on\par \par \uc2 Wednesday tempered appetite for riskier assets after they showed unexpectedly weak activity in Germany - the euro zone's most powerful economy - and in France.\par \par \uc2 The survey also showed continued weakness in Greece, which secured a 130-billion-euro rescue package on Tuesday to avoid a messy default after agreeing to a series of austerity measures.\par \par \uc2 The markets see Greece struggling to meet the demands of its new bailout deal.\par \par \uc2 "We will see some profit taking in the next month or two as we get closer to the general elections (in Greece). I think the real risk is what will the new leadership in Greece do," said Michael Woolfolk, an \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist with BNY Mellon in New York.\par \par \uc2 "That type of uncertainty is going to be a cloud over the market. It's going to be a good excuse to take profit on emerging markets, emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , commodities and equities."\par \par \uc2 Mexico's peso lost 0.42 percent to 12.8450\par \par \uc2 per U.S. dollar while the Chilean peso slipped 0.41 percent to bid at 483.40 per per dollar.\par \par \uc2 The Markit Eurozone Composite Flash PMI fell to 49.7 in February from 50.4 last month, below expectations for a rise to 50.6 and under the 50 line that divides growth from contraction.\par \par \uc2 Preliminary data that showed China's manufacturing sector contracting also added to investors' worries that hurt the prices of key commodities such as copper.\par \par \uc2 Chile is the world's top producer of copper, a metal key to building cars, homes and electricity lines.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Rachel Uranga; Editing by Diane Craft)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-LATAM/\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020120225e82m000iv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
