\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-Latam  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  slips on US data, downgrades\b0\par\par\uc2 561 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Februar 2012\par 17:41\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * U.S. retail data worse than expected\par \par \uc2 * Brazil's real weakens 0.3 pct, Mexico's peso loses 0.5 pct\par \par \uc2 By Rachel Uranga and Jean Luis Arce\par \par \uc2 MEXICO CITY, Feb 14 (Reuters) - Latin American \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakened on Tuesday after poorer than expected U.S. retail sales and Monday's credit downgrade of six European nations knocked riskier assets worldwide.\par \par \uc2 Brazil's real pulled back after firming to a 3-1/2-month high on Monday. The real lost 0.37 percent to bid at 1.7210 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 Citing risks of Europe's credit crisis, rating agency \uc2 Moody's\uc2  cut the credit ratings of six countries including Spain and Portugal while for the first time it placed Britain's prized top credit rating in jeopardy.\par \par \uc2 "It was bad news," said Eduardo Suarez, an analyst with Scotia Bank in Toronto. "Mexico was the one that reacted strongest to it."\par \par \uc2 Hanging over markets is whether Greece will secure a second bailout needed to save it from a chaotic default that could throw international financial markets in disarray.\par \par \uc2 Mexico's peso is the most freely traded \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Latin America, allowing speculators to easily pile on bearish bets when global markets sour.\par \par \uc2 Mexico's peso slipped 0.51 percent to 12.7650 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 Further pressuring the peso, U.S. retail sales rose less than expected in January as consumers cut back on car purchases and shopped less online.\par \par \uc2 The United States is Mexico's top trading partner and a slump in the economy harms Mexican exports.\par \par \uc2 Latin American \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  saw a huge rally at the start of the year, stoked by improving economic data from the United States and bets Europe's debt crisis could ease. Before its string of losses since last week, the Mexican peso had gained about 10 percent in 2012.\par \par \uc2 "The trader is looking for whatever pretext to take profits," said Jorge Gordillo, an analyst at CI Banco in Mexico City.\par \par \uc2 Chile's peso bid 0.9 percent weaker at 484.50 per dollar, pulling back from a five-month high last week as the price for copper, the country's top export, slipped.\par \par \uc2 Euro zone finance ministers dropped plans on Tuesday for an in-person meeting on Greece's new international bailout, as the cabinet in Athens argued over an austerity plan needed to secure the rescue package.\par \par \uc2 "When things become clearer (in Greece) in a few weeks, the enthusiasm is going to return," Gordillo said.\par \par \uc2 Of the 152 \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  tracked by Thomson Reuters, Brazil, Colombia and Mexico are in the top six gainers this year, advancing more than 8 percent.\par \par \uc2 The strong gains are hurting Latin American exporters, since costlier local \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  make manufacturers less competitive against cheaper imports.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in its spot market last week for the first time since September. Traders said they were expecting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to take further measures to curb the recent appreciation of the real.\par \par \uc2 Investors are wary that further gains toward 1.70 per dollar could trigger more \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , with some fearing a new round of capital controls.\par \par \uc2 Brazilian Finance Minister Guido Mantega denied a report the government is considering raising taxes on floating-rate debt investments, saying that no tax increases of any kind are planned at this time.\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-LATAM/\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020120217e82e00140\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
