\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil Real Weaker Early As Market Watches  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Moves\b0\par\par\uc2 By Gerald Jeffris   \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 499 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Februar 2012\par 12:50\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 BRASILIA (\uc2 Dow Jones\uc2 )-- The Brazilian real was slightly weaker in early trading Tuesday as investors evaluated the likelihood the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would maintain a strong presence in the market to curb the strength of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 As of 1130 GMT, the real traded at BRL1.7250 to the dollar after ending at BRL1.7212 Monday according to Tullett Prebon via Factset.\par \par \uc2 A sudden jump into the markets by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in recent sessions has had market participants putting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's target level for dollar purchase \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at around BRL1.70 to the dollar.\par \par \uc2 "Just as we had expected, the [real] is likely to find it very difficult to break out from the 1.7-1.9 range as an ambitious policy strategy aims to prevent further deindustrialization along with containing inflation expectations," said analysts at Santander Economia in a note Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 They added, however, that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  should face difficulties strengthening beyond the BRL1.7 to the dollar mark as investors show concerns over the ongoing impact of adverse fallout from the Greek and European debt crises.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  twice over the last two sessions, buying dollars in spot and forward auctions for the first time in five months.\par \par \uc2 Brazil's real has gained about 8% against the dollar since the beginning of the year under the influence of heavy overseas financing activity by companies operating locally and continued flows of portfolio investment into the country.\par \par \uc2 Among events recently influencing the market was Brazil's $14 billion privatization of major local airports this week and large-scale overseas debt sales by state-run oil company \uc2 Petrobras\uc2  (PBR) and top local telecom Oi (TNLP4.BR).\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, market participants say they believe the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will remain on guard for sudden strengthening of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as investors seek emerging market alternatives for their money as a haven from turbulence in Europe.\par \par \uc2 "We would expect Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BCB) to continue efforts to prevent the [real] from strengthening unchecked, especially given strong M&A flows presently being seen," said HSBC Global Research analysts Clyde Wardle and Marjorie Hernandez in a note Monday.\par \par \uc2 Questions remain, meanwhile, on how strong either fixed or variable income returns will be locally this year as the country struggles to maintain growth amid an uncertain global scenario.\par \par \uc2 Top officials from Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  have hinted the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  will maintain a rate easing cycle in the first half of this year despite elevated inflation as it fights to prop up weakening activity in the local economy.\par \par \uc2 The bank has cut its reference Selic rate by two percentage points since August to 10.5% despite 12-month inflation near the 6.5% upper limit of the country's inflation targeting band.\par \par \uc2 --By Gerald Jeffris, \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\uc2 ; (5561) 9162-7863, gerald.jeffris@dowjones.com [ 07-02-12 1150GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120207e827000zj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
