\par\par \b \uc2 Emerging Market  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2 , Debt Weaker On Concerns About Greece\b0\par\par\uc2 By Prabha Natarajan and Erin McCarthy   \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 583 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Februar 2012\par 21:39\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 NEW YORK (Dow Jones)--Emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and debt were a tad weaker as markets took a pause Monday from last week's rally.\par \par \uc2 Greece, or the lack of an outcome from its debt negotiations, weighed on investors. The euphoria of Friday's strong U.S. employment numbers faded fast as Greek failed to meet deadlines on the finalization of a deal. Some investors saw this as an opportunity for profit-talking after many \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  posted 5% to 8% gains against the dollar so far this year.\par \par \uc2 "The overriding concern in the market right now just seems to be the stalling problems with the Greek negotiations," said Carl Forcheski, director of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at \uc2 Societe Generale\uc2 , adding that the market "is starting to get a little anxious."\par \par \uc2 Emerging market sovereign debt was nearly unchanged on the day, as the spread on the \uc2 J.P. Morgan\uc2  Emerging Markets Bond Index Global, or Embig, widened by two basis points to 390 basis points over Treasurys. In price terms, its index edged down just 0.1%. Venezuela's debt firmed slightly; its spread tightened by six basis points to 1084 basis points over Treasurys. In price, however, its index fell 0.3%.\par \par \uc2 Issuance by Latin American issuers continued with \uc2 Brasil Telecom SA\uc2  (BTMC, BRTO4.BR), a subsidiary of Oi, launching a $1.5 billion offering of 10-year notes in U.S. credit markets Monday, according to a person familiar with the deal. The bonds will offer investors a yield of around 5.75%, compared to original pricing guidance of 6% and revised guidance of 5.85%.\par \par \uc2 Sao Paulo bank \uc2 Banco Santander Brasil\uc2  also plans to issue a benchmark-sized bond sale of five-year notes, with early price guidance at 415 basis points over the five-year Treasury rate.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  once again \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday, buying dollars in the first spot-market auction in nearly five months, shortly after the real hit an intra-day high. The real was trading at BRL1.7260 against the dollar late afternoon Monday, according to CQG data.\par \par \uc2 Mexico, which hasn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , was almost flat Monday and stuck to a MXN12.61 to MXN12.77 range against the dollar. The peso, which was expected to tighten to MXN12.5 by year end, already is near this key level.\par \par \uc2 The South African rand was much weaker earlier in the day, after the country's ruling party stepped away from mine nationalization in a bid to reassure investors and revive a weak economy. The dollar traded up to ZAR7.6529 before weakening a bit to ZAR7.5565, according to CQG data.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the Polish zloty hit a five-month high against the euro earlier in the day on the back of a surge in interest in Poland as investors see a break in its correlation with its neighbors. The Polish zloty, which is expected to strengthen further this year on the back of its resistance to a European slowdown, firmed to PLN4.1743 against the euro.\par \par \uc2 "As long as the market senses that the European recession is not too deep and that the U.S. economy can continue to gain some traction, that's good for EM countries," Forcheski said.\par \par \uc2 -By Prabha Natarajan, Dow Jones Newswires; 212-416-2468; prabha.natarajan@dowjones.com @djfxtrader\par \par \uc2 --Paul Kiernan and Patrick McGee contributed to this article. [ 06-02-12 2039GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120206e8260018y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
