\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS- \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  real strengthens despite  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 535 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Februar 2012\par 17:03\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's real briefly reverses gains after \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 * Real ends stronger on positive U.S. jobs data\par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  buys forwards first time this year\par \par \uc2 * Mexico, Chile pesos gain amid better global views\par \par \uc2 (Adds fresh analyst quote, closing prices)\par \par \uc2 By Silvio Cascione and Jos\u233\'00\'E9 de Castro\par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO, Feb 3 (Reuters) - The Brazilian real closed firmer on Friday, extending its winning streak to four straight days after shrugging off \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  aimed at stemming a rise in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  that could potentially hurt profits of exporters and manufacturers.\par \par \uc2 The real closed 0.3 0 percent stronger at\par \par \uc2 1.7 166 to the dollar , marking the fifth straight week of gains. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  briefly reversed similar gains earlier in the day after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  called an auction to buy U.S. dollar forwards -- its first \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year .\par \par \uc2 By buying forwards, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  soaks up excess dollars in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market by capping future supply of the greenback.\par \par \uc2 However, a jump in U.S. job creation bolstered the real.\par \par \uc2 "More encouraging data out of the United States helped strengthen the real," said Jose Carlos Amado, a trader with Renascenca Corretora in Sao Paulo. "But from now on the market will likely remain very attentive of further \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 The bank's first attempt to arrest the real's 8.3 percent jump this year indicates worries among government policymakers over the size and impact of the rally on exports and economic growth. A stronger \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  usually makes Brazilian-made goods less competitive in global markets, hampering export revenue.\par \par \uc2 The last time \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was on Dec. 15, when it tried to sell dollars on the spot market after the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakened sharply on fears the global economy was slipping back into recession.\par \par \uc2 Some of the gains in the real stem from massive capital inflows from investors seeking high-yielding, riskier assets such as Latin American stocks, bonds and \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . A record $7.1 billion flowed into the Brazilian stock market last month, according to data by BM&FBovespa, the exchange operator.\par \par \uc2 Brazilian President Dilma Rousseff is seeking to help local carmakers by hiking taxes on some foreign-made cars last year. She also wants to rework a long-standing deal with Mexico for tariff-free bilateral trade in automobiles and parts.\par \par \uc2 Other major Latin American \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  kept strengthening on Friday on positive job data in the United States added to market optimism that the global economy is improving.\par \par \uc2 Chile's peso ended the day\par \par \uc2 at a fresh 4-1/2 month high, boosted by rising prices for top export copper.[ ID:nL2E8D32FC]\par \par \uc2 The Mexican peso\par \par \uc2 was trading 0. 84 percent firmer.\par \par \uc2 "As world volatility comes down investors are getting more constructive and you see a resumption of carry trade and a search for higher yields," said Igor Arsenin, an emerging market strategist with \uc2 Credit Suisse\uc2 . "Authorities in Brazil are very sensitive to the level of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . We are likely to see more \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 (Writing by Alonso Soto and Guillermo Parra-Bernal; Editing by Andrew Hay and Diane Craft)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-LATAM/\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020120206e8230018t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
