\par\par \b \uc2 2nd UPDATE:  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Steps In As  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Gains\b0\par\par\uc2 682 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Februar 2012\par 20:02\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 --\b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in market for first time in five months\par \par \uc2 --Bank buys unspecified volume of U.S. dollars for Mar 20 delivery\par \par \uc2 --\b \highlight22\uc2 Interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , using various tools, became common in past years\par \par \uc2 (Updates with additional comment, background throughout.)\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Paulo Winterstein and Paul Kiernan \par    Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SAO PAULO (Dow Jones)--The Brazilian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on Friday showed its growing discomfort with the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's recent strength against the U.S. dollar, stepping into the market to ease demand for the Brazilian real for the first time in five months.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Following a five-week rally that saw Brazil's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  gain some 8% against the greenback, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  held an auction Friday, buying dollars for March 20 delivery. Such measures, tending to weaken the real, haven't been employed since September, when the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was in the midst of a selloff that saw it end 2011 at BRL1.8625 to the dollar.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Friday, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  bought an unspecified volume of dollars for March 20 delivery at BRL1.7383 each.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reflects renewed concerns about the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's strength--a byproduct of stabilizing world financial markets--in a country whose manufacturers and exporters often struggle to compete with cheaper imported products.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 In past years, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  became quite common, with the bank often buying or selling dollars on a daily basis. However, in recent months, the government appeared content to allow a steady depreciation of the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  as a way to boost exports and protect manufacturers.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The real has gained steadily against the dollar so far this year. A wave of bond issues by Brazilian companies abroad--including a $7 billion deal by state oil giant \f28 \uc2 \f2 Petroleo Brasileiro\f28 \uc2 \f2  (PETR4.BR, PBR), or \f28 \uc2 \f2 Petrobras\f28 \uc2 \f2 --and growing appetite for high-yielding, emerging-market assets have fueled strong investment flows to Brazil, pushing the real up against the greenback.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Flavia Cattan-Naslausky, a \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strategist at RBS Securities in the U.S., noted that the bulk of capital inflows to Brazil so far this year have gone into the "real economy" in the form of corporate debt issuance abroad rather than short-term fixed-income investments. Dollar futures on the Brazilian Mercantile and Futures Exchange don't point to expectations for significant appreciation by the real in coming months, she added.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "Taking that into consideration, I would not read the decision as being a broader or more important \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  signal," Cattan-Naslausky said. "In the past, when there was a change in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  policy, it was usually triggered by concerns that the money coming in was driven by speculative flows."\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The real exited active trading Friday slightly stronger on the day at BRL1.7158, as investors cheered better-than-expected employment data from the U.S.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Friday's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  came days after the most recent warning from Brazilian Finance Minister Guido Mantega, who said in late January that the government planned to "continue with our policy of preventing the appreciation of the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ." Authorities last year unleashed wave after wave of measures aimed at slowing the entry of speculative cash that had pushed the real to renewed strength against the dollar.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Though market participants in recent weeks have increasingly eyed the possibility of renewed \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , some were hesitant to declare a return of the so-called "\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  wars"--a term used to describe the periodic rollout of capital controls and near-daily dollar purchases by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Luiz Carlos Baldan, a director at Sao Paulo's Fourtrade brokerage, characterized Friday's auction as a "thermometer."\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  decided to hold this auction to see how demand would look," Baldan said, adding that he sees the government aiming to keep the real between BRL1.75 and BRL1.85 this year. "It's premature to say that this is the first step in a new series of measures."\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -By Paulo Winterstein and Paul Kiernan, Dow Jones Newswires; 55-11-3544-7073; paulo.winterstein@dowjones.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 --Rogerio Jelmayer in Sao Paulo contributed to this article. [ 03-02-12 1902GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120203e823001c4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
