\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's Real Opens Weaker As Investors See  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Risk\b0\par\par\uc2 By Paul Kiernan   \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 523 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Februar 2012\par 13:21\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's real opened weaker against the dollar Friday ahead of key U.S. employment data and as recent gains have left investors increasingly wary of possible government \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 Around 7 a.m. EST, the real was quoted in Sao Paulo trading at BRL1.7409 to the dollar, according to Tullett Prebon via FactSet, compared with BRL1.7205 at Thursday's close.\par \par \uc2 Brazilian financial markets, which often are heavily influenced by economic news abroad, will likely have a close eye on the U.S. Labor Department's monthly nonfarm payrolls report, due out at 8:30 a.m. EST. Economists tend to study the data for signs of improvement in the U.S. labor market, which remains feeble some two years after the global economic recession.\par \par \uc2 Signals from the U.S. Federal Reserve that it intends to keep interest rates at near zero until 2014 to shore up the economy "has strengthened the argument" for investing in emerging-market assets, \uc2 Credit Suisse\uc2  said in a research note.\par \par \uc2 Traders say investment flows to Brazil have been strong since the beginning of the year, supporting a nearly uninterrupted rally in the real, which ended 2011 around BRL1.86 to the dollar.\par \par \uc2 Reginaldo Siaca, a manager at Sao Paulo's Advanced brokerage, said heavy inflows mean the real should continue trending stronger.\par \par \uc2 "Interest rates in the U.S. aren't going up any time soon, so the market looks quite attractive for foreign clients," Siaca said.\par \par \uc2 But he said that BRL1.70 is considered a key level, beyond which concerns about competitiveness would likely spur the government to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to slow the real's gains.\par \par \uc2 Reports Thursday that the Brazilian government is considering charging import taxes on cars produced in Mexico reinforce opinions that the real's gains this year are already causing worries about lost competitiveness, Santander bank said. That, in turn, "suggests that the risks of [\b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 ] \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  may be rising in the short term."\par \par \uc2 "We would expect the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to first start buying [dollars] in the spot [market], but rhetoric can escalate and other new and creative mechanisms may be in the works if the real remains on a strengthening trend," Santander said.\par \par \uc2 Such measures were a fact of life for investors in Brazil last year, when the real surged to around BRL1.55 to the dollar before the European debt crisis sent it reeling along with other emerging-market assets.\par \par \uc2 But at least one key factor for the exchange market has changed since then. Local interest rates, which guarantee returns on fixed-income investments, are widely considered to be on a downward path.\par \par \uc2 Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Alexandre Tombini said Thursday that authorities "have room" to cut the key Selic rate, which currently stands at 10.5%, without jeopardizing inflation goals. The rate in mid-2011 peaked at 12.5%.\par \par \uc2 -By Paul Kiernan, Dow Jones Newswires; (+55)11-3544-7074, paul.kiernan@dowjones.com [ 03-02-12 1221GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1156 1843   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120203e8230010j\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw427\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal6405\pichgoal600
