\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil Real Opens Little Changed As Attention Turns To Greece\b0\par\par\uc2 By Paul Kiernan   \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 508 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Januar 2012\par 13:36\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO (Dow Jones)--Brazil's real was little changed in early trading Friday as the dollar held up against other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and investors kept an eye on negotiations between Greece and its private creditors.\par \par \uc2 Around 7:20 a.m. EST, the real stood at BRL1.7654 to the dollar, according to Tullett Prebon via FactSet, very slightly weaker than its Thursday close of BRL1.7650.\par \par \uc2 The real, which frequently reacts to developments in international markets, has remained steady in recent sessions amid generally positive news about the U.S. economy. A wave of sovereign ratings downgrades last week in Europe, the main source of concern for investors in volatile \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, did little to derail the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Reports that the Greek government and its private-sector creditors were nearing a debt-restructuring deal encouraged investors ahead of the opening bell in U.S. financial markets. Talks between the two sides resumed this week after breaking down last Friday on the basis of interest rates that Greece would pay its bondholders.\par \par \uc2 In a 2012 outlook released Friday, \uc2 HSBC\uc2 's Pablo Goldberg, head of the bank's global emerging-markets research team, said he favors the Brazilian real and Colombian peso among Latin American \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "We see the (real) range-bound between BRL1.75 and BRL1.90 for most of this year," Goldberg said in the report. "High growth and interest-rate differentials should continue to attract strong \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  inflows, but a more dovish \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and an unstable \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  regulatory environment are real-negative."\par \par \uc2 Though growth has slowed from 2010's red-hot pace of 7.5%, Brazil's gross domestic product is still expected to outpace the rest of the world's largest economies this year, as the U.S. struggles with high unemployment and Europe battles its debt crisis. Brazil remains home to some of the highest real interest rates in the world, even after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  cut its overnight Selic rate by 50 basis points this week, to 10.50%.\par \par \uc2 HSBC\uc2  said the likelihood of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the exchange market "supports our rangebound view," and added that commodity prices will also be a key factor for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Brazil's shipments of raw goods such as sugar, coffee, soybeans, orange juice, meat and metals place it among the world's top commodities exporters.\par \par \uc2 The real spent much of last year at levels that exporters and industry found uncomfortably strong against the dollar. Though the real's value remains well below mid-2011 levels of near BRL1.55, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has rallied since closing 2011 at BRL1.8642.\par \par \uc2 The gains have prompted speculation about whether local authorities might start \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in exchange market to stem the real's rise if they see it threatening the country's competitiveness.\par \par \uc2 -By Paul Kiernan, Dow Jones Newswires; (+55)11-3544-7074; paul.kiernan@dowjones.com [ 20-01-12 1236GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1156 1843   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120120e81k000rd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw145\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2175\pichgoal600
