\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil Real Slightly Weaker On Renewed Europe Worries\b0\par\par\uc2 480 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 Oktober 2011\par 13:13\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 --Real weakens to BRL1.6850/dollar vs. BRL1.6795 Friday\par \par \uc2 --Investors worry about funding for Europe rescue plan\par \par \uc2 --Brazil government wary of any abrupt \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves\par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO (Dow Jones)--The Brazilian real weakened slightly against the U.S. dollar in early trading Monday on renewed worries about the European debt crisis.\par \par \uc2 The real was trading at BRL1.6850 to the dollar early in the session, weaker than the Friday close of BRL1.6795, according to Tullett Prebon via FactSet.\par \par \uc2 European leaders last week announced a broad rescue plan for debt-plagued governments and banks in the region. However, details on funding for the plan remained sketchy.\par \par \uc2 Worries were exacerbated over the weekend by comments from China's official news agency indicating reluctance by Chinese authorities to advance any financial aid to Europe.\par \par \uc2 "What investors are saying today to the Europeans is, 'Show me the money!'," said Guilherme Monoco, a trader at Sao Paulo's Hencorp Commcor brokerage.\par \par \uc2 Worries about funding for the European rescue plan led to losses for the euro against the U.S. dollar Monday. International metals and oil prices were down. Lower commodities prices tend to hurt the Brazilian real, since many Brazilian exporters depend on commodities prices for revenues.\par \par \uc2 Traders said the possibility of government \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  lurks in the background of \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's market.\par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is unlikely Monday, because the real is weakening a bit," Monoco said. "However, any reversal could see a government move in the market. They don't want the real to strengthen too much."\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's government \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily in the market earlier this year when the real strengthened to BRL1.55 to the dollar. The strong real hurts exporters and manufacturers. \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came in the form of higher taxes on certain foreign investment inflows as well as frequent purchases of dollars from the market.\par \par \uc2 Such a view was reinforced in comments at a seminar Friday by a top \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official. \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Credit \b \highlight22\uc2 Operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  Director Sidnei Marques said a new, highly automated \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  system "gives the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  the opportunity to view and identify any abrupt movements in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  that might do harm to the market." Marques said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will act "with timely \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 " to maintain an orderly \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 Monday marks the expiry of monthly \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures contracts. The expiry often leads to volatility on Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market because the contracts are closed out based on the average \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  quotation, or Ptax rate, on the last working day of the month.\par \par \uc2 However, traders said this month's expiry was likely to be calm. "Most of these contracts were rolled over Friday," Monoco said. "The volume of rollovers Monday will be low."\par \par \uc2 -By Tom Murphy, Dow Jones Newswires; 55-11-3544-7090; brazil@dowjones.com [ 31-10-11 1213GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1156 1843   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020111031e7av001fc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
