\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil To Modernize Inter-Bank Market In 2012 - \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 434 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Oktober 2011\par 16:55\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    DOW JONES NEWSWIRES \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SAO PAULO (Dow Jones)--Brazil's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will kick off a broad technical and regulatory modernization of its inter-bank market in July of 2012, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Monetary Policy Director Aldo Mendes said Friday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 He said the modernization will be modeled after a similar effort that began on October 1 for Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. The \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  modernization was based on technical upgrades of computer-driven trading and monitoring \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Mendes said.\par \par \uc2 "The new \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  system creates greater transparency for all involved in the market, including the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  itself," said Mendes at a seminar in Sao Paulo. "It has led to lower costs for all and we expect \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  agents to pass these savings on to their clients."\par \par \uc2 Geraldo Siqueira, director of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  regulatory bureau, said at the same event that "Costs for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  itself in monitoring and processing \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  transactions have fallen by 70% since October 1. We don't expect all of this saving to be passed on by agents to their clients, but certainly some of it will."\par \par \uc2 Mendes said the new \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  system introduced on October 1 reduces paperwork and regulations for virtually all \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  transactions. But at the same time it gives the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  greater and faster access to information about \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  flows and transactions.\par \par \uc2 "We expect to be able to achieve the same gains in transparency and efficiency for the inter-bank market when a new modernization system is introduced in July 2012," he said.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Credit \b \highlight22\uc2 Operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  Director Sidnei Marques said the new \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  system "gives the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  the opportunity to view and identify any abrupt movements in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  that might do harm to the market."\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has consistently \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in recent years, buying and selling dollars or holding auctions of dollar-linked futures contracts. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  held a swap auction of dollar-linked contracts earlier Friday, selling the equivalent of $791 million in swaps to the market.\par \par \uc2 Marques said the new \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  system will lead to "more timely and well targeted" market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 central-bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market are typically aimed at damping volatility, Marques noted. He also said the new \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  system will help the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to better identify possible money laundering or other illicit \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 -By Tom Murphy, Dow Jones Newswires; 55-11-3544-7090; brazil@dowjones.com [ 28-10-11 1515GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020111028e7as001lk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
